    "detailed_description": "Once we all had dreams and looked forward to the future, but as time went by, most of us gradually live like their parents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Whether you are free of the rules set by your parents, or you are more willing to follow your parents' advice, I hope this short visual game will bring you some small feelings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n When young: learn everything quickly, was praised by the elders that they are talented,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYouth: laughing and playing, gradually have ignorant feelings,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYouth: away from home, in order to live a life, although hard, but did not give up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Middle age: have your own child, but with the child time, but less and less, for the family, your pressure becomes more and more big<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOld age: take care of the child, seems to live like the father, feeling also accepted such an arrangement",
